                <pb facs="0384" n="362" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v01/pg362"/>

                <head>162. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>For text of National Security Action Memorandum No. 104, October 13, 1961, see
                        <hi rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>,
                    Book 11, page 328.NSAM No. 104 was transmitted
                    to the Secretaries of State and Defense and the Director of Central Intelligence
                    in a memorandum from McGeorge Bundy that
                    conveyed the results of Presidential directives on Viet-Nam approved on October
                    11.</p>
            </div>
